  "details": "\"Quick Menu Info\" is an ambiguous string, which is difficult to translate.\n\n\"Quick Menu Info\" alone is not clear enough to understand what the setting means.\n\n\"Quick Menu Info\" is a function to show additional information on nameplates. So please change it to \"Show Additional Info on Nameplates\".\n\nThis would be easier to translate and make it easier for English users to understand what the settings are.",
